{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03315",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 3.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.48,
      "end_seconds": 8.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "right, you know, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.09,
      "end_seconds": 12.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Alright, did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.48,
      "end_seconds": 21.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "I mean, um, not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.98,
      "end_seconds": 23.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.7,
      "end_seconds": 32.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "it's a temperature, mostly it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 32.75,
      "end_seconds": 47.79,
      "duration_seconds": 15.04,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the the readings for you. SpO2 98 percent on room air, blood pressure 119 over 80, temperature 38.2, pulse is 92 beats a minute, weight 82 kilos, height 184 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.43,
      "end_seconds": 50.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.86,
      "end_seconds": 61.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Alright, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.3,
      "end_seconds": 70.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "it's, It's been four weeks, I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.54,
      "end_seconds": 77.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.55,
      "end_seconds": 100.43,
      "duration_seconds": 21.88,
      "text": "Hmm, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. Honestly, a few times a day. As for red sore wound after my operation, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.63,
      "end_seconds": 106.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Did you get breathlessness, chest pain, vomiting or calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.54,
      "end_seconds": 114.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "No breathlessness, chest pain, vomiting or calf pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.73,
      "end_seconds": 118.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "sure any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.48,
      "end_seconds": 122.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.59,
      "end_seconds": 134.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.42,
      "end_seconds": 142.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.74,
      "end_seconds": 146.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.26,
      "end_seconds": 156.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "I've, I've had an underactive thyroid, yes. I have epilepsy, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.56,
      "end_seconds": 167.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.02,
      "text": "Yes, an underactive thyroid is known to to us, good to have that clear. So, what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.51,
      "end_seconds": 186.41,
      "duration_seconds": 17.9,
      "text": "Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning. Oh, you know, I'm on sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, twice a day. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.73,
      "end_seconds": 188.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Sure. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.16,
      "end_seconds": 193.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.63,
      "end_seconds": 194.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.62,
      "end_seconds": 200.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.06,
      "end_seconds": 204.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.69,
      "end_seconds": 210.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.45,
      "end_seconds": 217.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.75,
      "end_seconds": 223.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.25,
      "end_seconds": 227.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.59,
      "end_seconds": 232.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.79,
      "end_seconds": 237.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.88,
      "end_seconds": 241.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "no surgery, um, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.12,
      "end_seconds": 246.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.67,
      "end_seconds": 250.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Take a a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.22,
      "end_seconds": 273.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "the lower part of the wound is red, hot and weeping pus, and the edges have not come together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.98,
      "end_seconds": 281.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.89,
      "end_seconds": 295.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "putting it all together, my working impression is a surgical wound infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.38,
      "end_seconds": 298.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.67,
      "end_seconds": 315.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.68,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a surgical wound infection do well once it's treated properly. We should do a wound swab for wound infection. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with wound infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.8,
      "end_seconds": 318.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.49,
      "end_seconds": 350.98,
      "duration_seconds": 30.49,
      "text": "we'll begin with flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, seven days. It's for wound infection. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Keep it clean and dry and use fresh dressings daily. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Let's review you in two days. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.81,
      "end_seconds": 364.64,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "So, I take the flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.66,
      "end_seconds": 372.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.85,
      "end_seconds": 377.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.3,
      "end_seconds": 379.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}